      "created": 1788350324,
      "updated": 1788352813
    },
    {
      "id": "6a980af5000000000019931d",
      "text": "  > \t[AWK]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788349173,
      "updated": 1788349173
    },
    {
      "id": "6a980ad50000000000199311",
      "text": " 　  ZZ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788349141,
      "updated": 1788351505
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9815b2000000000019934e",
      "text": " 　直交軸にできないものだろうか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788351922,
      "updated": 1788351953
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2665e90c0000090c222",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60508ed36a7abc00235e90c0",
      "created": 1693577829,
      "updated": 1693577829
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97c559000000000036818d",
      "text": "頭字語の発音に関する話題を見るたびに[GIFの発音]についての動画を思い出してる[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788331354,
      "updated": 1788331491
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97c5780000000000368190",
      "text": " [GIFの発音#6a97c6000000000000368191]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788331385,
      "updated": 1788331549
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9806590000000000199309",
      "text": " 全人類が岐阜派とgiraffe派とに二分して永劫の闘争を繰り広げていたあの大戦がまさか大本営発表一つで終結してしまうとは、あの頃はまさか思ってもみませんでした[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788347993,
      "updated": 1788348388
    },
    {
      "id": "6a9806da000000000019930a",
      "text": " 　なお未だに岐阜派の残党による小競り合いが生じる模様。おのれ岐阜県民…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788348123,
      "updated": 1788348409
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97c559000000000036818e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1788331354,
      "updated": 1788331354
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6dd",
      "text": "読めない略語",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1693577737
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6de",
      "text": "　[WYSIWYG]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1693577737
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6df",
      "text": "　\t読める[inajob.icon][nishio.icon][bsahd.icon][綾坂こと.icon]",
      "userId": "62919f6444e78d001d73e522",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1725195702
    },
    {
      "id": "64f26e3c79d3a90000e37837",
      "text": "　\t読めるけどスペルを覚えてない率が高い[sta.icon][はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1693609534,
      "updated": 1725154656
    },
    {
      "id": "66d3c566b8bbfc0000ec6186",
      "text": " 　\tYとIがわからないので頭の中で正称を唱えながら書くしかない[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1725154662,
      "updated": 1725154715
    },
    {
      "id": "66d3d36daff09e0000139593",
      "text": " 　\twhat you see is what you getで覚えてれば間違いようがない[nishio.icon][bsahd.icon]",
      "userId": "661b6e882a96e9002371b3c2",
      "created": 1725158254,
      "updated": 1725194778
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6e0",
      "text": "　[WHATWG]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1693577737
    },
    {
      "id": "67a6f53e71b3c20000cea06a",
      "text": "　\tWhat, WGと分割して読む[bsahd.icon]",
      "userId": "661b6e882a96e9002371b3c2",
      "created": 1738995006,
      "updated": 1738995014
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6e1",
      "text": "　[CHIMPO]: [Chief Impact Officer] の略",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1693577737
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2c171fa0800005e7c21",
      "text": "　 読める[biwa.icon]",
      "userId": "62c8e96f1f5ebf001d71fa08",
      "created": 1693577922,
      "updated": 1693577927
    },
    {
      "id": "64f1f2076eb406000018f6e2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1693577737,
      "updated": 1693577737
    },
    {
      "id": "6a97cc4c000000000024443f",
      "text": "アルファベットの読み方が独特、というので[ASUS]を思い出すが、会社名だから当てはまらないか[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1788333132,
      "updated": 1788333215
    },
    {
      "id": "6a98024f00000000001992fd",
      "text": " GNOME Foundation やUNESCOも法人格だと思う。それにASUSは接頭辞ではないようですね…[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1788346959,
      "updated": 1788347266
    },
    {
      "id": "6a98030000000000001992ff",
      "text": " 　[\" 芸術や学問におけるインスピレーションの象徴となっているギリシャ神話の空飛ぶ白馬“ペガサス・Pegasus”。この最後の四文字がASUSの由来です。]──https://www.asus.com/jp/About_ASUS/about_asus_history_name/",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
